used by \code{\link[=beta_weights_on_grid]{beta_weights_on_grid()}} and \code{\link[=assurance_prior_weights]{assurance_prior_weights()}}).
Unnamed vectors are accepted only when their length equals the number of
unique effect values, in which case they are applied in ascending order.
\item \strong{Distribution list} — a list with at minimum \verb{$dist} naming one of
\code{"normal"} (\code{mean}, \code{sd}), \code{"uniform"} (\code{min}, \code{max}), or \code{"beta"}
(\code{shape1}/\code{shape2} \strong{or} \code{mode}/\code{n}).  Weights are computed by
